    "interpretation": "Descriptive external-validity follow-up on a public development split; not a replacement for frozen hidden-v1 results.",
    "structured_output_policy": "Use each official API's strongest registered JSON constraint, retain the exact response-format hash, and report schema and semantic failures separately. Constraint strength differs by provider, so scores are not treated as a controlled provider ranking.",
    "full_phase_rule": "After GO, re-execute all 100 public-dev instances as a separate full phase; pilot outputs are not substituted into the full result.",
    "attempts_per_item_per_phase": 1,
    "sampling_parameters": "No temperature, top_p, or seed parameter is sent; each registered reasoning model uses its provider default apart from the frozen reasoning-effort setting.",
